1
00:00:05,804 --> 00:00:07,411
(All characters, organizations,
and events in this drama are fictitious.)

2
00:00:07,436 --> 00:00:09,158
(Filming followed broadcast guidelines
for minors. Some scenes used AI.)

3
00:00:15,418 --> 00:00:22,217
I won't disappoint, hurt,
or confuse Seo Hyeon anymore.

4
00:00:24,483 --> 00:00:26,719
What is that supposed to mean?

5
00:00:26,864 --> 00:00:29,237
It means I'm done being
your older brother.

6
00:00:30,311 --> 00:00:31,703
Mu Jin!

7
00:00:33,264 --> 00:00:37,611
So what you're saying is...

8
00:00:38,297 --> 00:00:43,577
Not as friends, but as a man
and a woman. Let's do this properly.

9
00:00:44,500 --> 00:00:46,181
What do you think you're doing?

10
00:00:46,371 --> 00:00:48,231
Are you playing with my daughter?

11
00:00:48,256 --> 00:00:50,840
- Is she that easy to you?
- Mom!

12
00:00:51,377 --> 00:00:52,879
She isn't easy to me.

13
00:00:53,857 --> 00:00:55,576
And I'm certainly not playing with her.

14
00:00:56,530 --> 00:01:01,597
If you'll give me the chance,
I'd like to start something with her.

15
00:01:02,696 --> 00:01:04,467
All because of some girl,

16
00:01:05,558 --> 00:01:08,693
you told us the woman you couldn't forget
for eight years had come back.

17
00:01:08,718 --> 00:01:11,286
- What about her?
- Mom!

18
00:01:11,631 --> 00:01:16,266
Everything ended with her.
Eight years ago.

19
00:01:18,131 --> 00:01:22,251
So? Is my daughter a stand-in?

20
00:01:22,404 --> 00:01:24,317
Mom, why are you doing this?

21
00:01:24,355 --> 00:01:25,805
That's not it.

22
00:01:25,937 --> 00:01:29,285
You don't love her. You pity her.

23
00:01:29,324 --> 00:01:32,152
Out of guilt, remorse, obligation.

24
00:01:32,496 --> 00:01:35,844
So what if it isn't love?
So what if it's pity?

25
00:01:35,869 --> 00:01:38,791
Guilt, a stand-in, who cares!

26
00:01:38,816 --> 00:01:40,669
Seo Hyeon!

27
00:01:46,311 --> 00:01:49,607
I don't know
what's going through your head,

28
00:01:52,377 --> 00:01:57,401
and maybe you just got carried away
for a moment and that's why you said it.

29
00:01:58,288 --> 00:02:02,342
I don't care. I'm fine with all of it.

30
00:02:05,850 --> 00:02:09,327
Thank you for telling me how you feel.

31
00:02:12,274 --> 00:02:13,790
Thank you so much.

32
00:02:46,407 --> 00:02:48,787
Mom, do you know how strange
you're being today?

33
00:02:49,416 --> 00:02:51,450
You're the strange one.

34
00:02:52,191 --> 00:02:54,116
Have you no pride at all?

35
00:02:55,431 --> 00:02:57,136
What could you possibly be lacking?

36
00:02:57,333 --> 00:03:01,346
What are you missing that you'd throw yourself
at a man who doesn't love you,

37
00:03:01,623 --> 00:03:04,996
practically begging?
What do you think you're doing?

38
00:03:05,021 --> 00:03:07,096
Why does love need pride?

39
00:03:07,304 --> 00:03:09,387
If it means I can have him,
what's wrong with begging?

40
00:03:09,724 --> 00:03:11,657
I'd do far more than that.

41
00:03:11,951 --> 00:03:14,776
How dare you say that in front of me...

42
00:03:16,324 --> 00:03:22,748
Do you think your father and I raised you
like a jewel to be treated this way?

43
00:03:23,357 --> 00:03:27,558
I must look like a complete fool to you,
but this is who I am.

44
00:03:28,330 --> 00:03:32,980
I hate myself for it too. I find it awful.
But this is who I am, Mom.

45
00:03:45,723 --> 00:03:49,313
- Gyu Rim.
- Su Nam, you're here.

46
00:03:49,977 --> 00:03:53,877
Gyu Rim, you shouldn't do that
to my Heung Sik.

47
00:03:54,024 --> 00:03:56,251
What on earth did you say to him?

48
00:03:56,417 --> 00:04:00,407
He's flat on his back groaning
like a fly that swallowed poison.

49
00:04:03,768 --> 00:04:07,926
I know that feeling. I've been there too.

50
00:04:08,350 --> 00:04:12,569
Until a while ago he was fine,
chewing away on dried squid,

51
00:04:12,620 --> 00:04:18,632
and the second he took your call
he became a complete mess.

52
00:04:18,657 --> 00:04:20,164
That's because of you, isn't it?

53
00:04:21,967 --> 00:04:24,133
Yes. It's because of me.

54
00:04:24,750 --> 00:04:27,971
So you went and said it after all.

55
00:04:28,444 --> 00:04:30,601
To a boy who isn't even healed yet.

56
00:04:30,636 --> 00:04:33,702
You told him Gyeol's father
was back, didn't you?

57
00:04:33,727 --> 00:04:36,872
- That isn't it, Su Nam.
- Then what is it?

58
00:04:38,711 --> 00:04:41,276
Heung Sik hasn't given me an answer yet.

59
00:04:41,811 --> 00:04:45,051
Once he does, I'll tell you
right away, Su Nam.

60
00:04:45,531 --> 00:04:48,617
All right. I understand.

61
00:04:48,751 --> 00:04:55,245
So now that Gyeol's father is back,
he should stop bothering you and back off?

62
00:04:55,551 --> 00:04:59,271
You've driven a knife
straight through my Heung Sik's heart.

63
00:04:59,296 --> 00:05:02,982
Gyeol has no father, Su Nam.
Gyeol is my son.

64
00:05:03,007 --> 00:05:07,002
I don't think I can look at you
the same way anymore.

65
00:05:09,524 --> 00:05:11,952
He ended up like that
saving your own child,

66
00:05:11,977 --> 00:05:14,619
and you can be that cruel to him?

67
00:05:14,890 --> 00:05:17,338
However pressed you were,

68
00:05:17,362 --> 00:05:21,909
you should have waited
until the cast came off my Heung Sik's arm.

69
00:05:22,064 --> 00:05:27,071
Does my Heung Sik have to put
a cast on his heart too?

70
00:05:30,137 --> 00:05:32,327
Are you unwell, Gyu Rim?

71
00:05:34,325 --> 00:05:37,205
Is something wrong with you,
proposing to just anyone like that?

72
00:05:37,230 --> 00:05:38,838
You have no idea how frightening men are.

73
00:05:44,784 --> 00:05:46,224
What is this?

74
00:05:49,497 --> 00:05:51,940
A grown man who could take down a bear
with his bare hands,

75
00:05:51,964 --> 00:05:55,611
sprawled out looking pathetic
over a few words like that.

76
00:05:56,357 --> 00:05:58,258
Get up this instant.

77
00:05:58,283 --> 00:06:00,994
Leave me alone.
I have things to think about.

78
00:06:01,019 --> 00:06:02,947
Think about what, exactly?

79
00:06:03,230 --> 00:06:06,315
Is Gyu Rim the only woman in the world?

80
00:06:06,590 --> 00:06:11,546
Just because I'm set on Gyu Rim,
why are you set on her too?

81
00:06:11,571 --> 00:06:14,848
- Don't you have a taste of your own?
- Please, stop!

82
00:06:15,231 --> 00:06:19,224
- A man needs confidence to the end.
- That hurts!

83
00:06:19,398 --> 00:06:21,311
How does an old woman have
such a heavy hand?

84
00:06:21,744 --> 00:06:25,327
You may not have a steady job,

85
00:06:25,490 --> 00:06:30,096
and objectively there may not be
one thing about you worth boasting of.

86
00:06:30,317 --> 00:06:34,075
But to me you're the finest son
in the whole world.

87
00:06:34,730 --> 00:06:38,346
Not even for Lim Young Woong
would I trade you!

88
00:06:38,371 --> 00:06:40,639
That's not what I meant, Mom!

89
00:06:40,664 --> 00:06:42,800
Then turn yourself over, you fool!

90
00:06:42,825 --> 00:06:46,060
Stop showing that pitiful face
to the mother who bore you!

91
00:06:46,085 --> 00:06:50,068
Gyu Rim asked me to date her, properly!

92
00:06:50,093 --> 00:06:53,225
So Gyu Rim asked you, properly...

93
00:06:57,519 --> 00:07:01,871
Now he's talking nonsense.

94
00:07:02,458 --> 00:07:05,872
Did that sign hit your head when it fell?

95
00:07:06,264 --> 00:07:08,171
How many is this?

96
00:07:08,464 --> 00:07:11,091
Three.

97
00:07:11,884 --> 00:07:14,895
I'm perfectly in my right mind.

98
00:07:14,978 --> 00:07:17,920
Gyu Rim really did propose to me!

99
00:07:17,945 --> 00:07:19,902
Is Gyu Rim the one who's unwell?

100
00:07:20,089 --> 00:07:21,913
Was she all right, Mom?

101
00:07:21,938 --> 00:07:26,149
So Gyu Rim really did ask you
to start seeing her?

102
00:07:26,267 --> 00:07:27,654
Yes!

103
00:07:34,789 --> 00:07:37,429
Goodness, what do I do?

104
00:07:37,804 --> 00:07:41,424
Why are you laughing like that?
It's frightening.

105
00:07:41,852 --> 00:07:43,752
What am I going to do?

106
00:07:43,998 --> 00:07:49,025
And there I was, saying all that to her...

107
00:07:50,171 --> 00:07:52,899
What am I to do with this mouth of mine?

108
00:07:53,563 --> 00:07:55,101
What did you say?

109
00:07:55,141 --> 00:07:58,646
Have you lost your mind?
What did you say to Gyu Rim?

110
00:07:58,671 --> 00:08:02,014
- I'm mortified.
- This is driving me mad.

111
00:08:02,039 --> 00:08:05,188
- What did you say?
- I don't know. What do I do?

112
00:08:21,824 --> 00:08:23,758
Gyeol, what are you doing?

113
00:08:25,344 --> 00:08:27,280
If you're not busy, shall we go on a date?

114
00:08:27,909 --> 00:08:29,902
(Damga Charcoal Grill)

115
00:08:34,325 --> 00:08:37,059
- Is it good?
- Yes, it's so good.

116
00:08:39,524 --> 00:08:43,315
I proposed to Cho Heung Sik today.

117
00:08:43,688 --> 00:08:44,910
Really?

118
00:08:45,131 --> 00:08:48,704
But I haven't heard back yet.
He might turn me down.

119
00:08:53,843 --> 00:08:55,287
Are you shocked?

120
00:08:57,171 --> 00:08:58,835
A little surprised.

121
00:08:59,602 --> 00:09:03,302
But was it because of me?

122
00:09:04,297 --> 00:09:08,242
Because you're grateful he saved me?

123
00:09:08,344 --> 00:09:12,797
That's part of it,
but it isn't the only reason.

124
00:09:12,944 --> 00:09:14,036
Then what?

125
00:09:16,387 --> 00:09:21,976
I don't know when it started,
but I've always felt a little cold inside.

126
00:09:22,551 --> 00:09:28,508
But being with Su Nam and Heung Sik
felt so warm and good.

127
00:09:28,691 --> 00:09:31,929
Like finding spring
in the middle of a blizzard.

128
00:09:32,227 --> 00:09:33,384
Really?

129
00:09:36,490 --> 00:09:41,504
And who am I to upset people
that good and make them cry?

130
00:09:41,997 --> 00:09:45,020
When making them smile every day
still wouldn't be enough.

131
00:09:45,277 --> 00:09:46,928
That was part of it too.

132
00:09:47,072 --> 00:09:51,572
And I told you I wished I had a father.

133
00:09:51,630 --> 00:09:53,933
Yes, that's one of the reasons.

134
00:09:54,057 --> 00:09:56,806
I see. I think I understand.

135
00:09:57,996 --> 00:09:59,409
You do?

136
00:10:00,487 --> 00:10:04,169
Honestly, my heart was pretty tangled up.

137
00:10:04,584 --> 00:10:08,343
But having you understand
makes me feel so much steadier.

138
00:10:08,991 --> 00:10:13,013
So will you marry Cho Heung Sik too?

139
00:10:13,304 --> 00:10:16,747
I don't know yet. He might turn me down.

140
00:10:16,811 --> 00:10:19,287
That will never happen.

141
00:10:19,404 --> 00:10:22,388
You have no idea how much he likes you.

142
00:10:22,990 --> 00:10:24,790
If he does turn you down, tell me.

143
00:10:24,977 --> 00:10:27,237
I'll go and have words with him.

144
00:10:32,826 --> 00:10:34,150
Hello, Seo Hyeon.

145
00:10:35,237 --> 00:10:38,277
- My mother rattled you, didn't she?
- Not at all.

146
00:10:39,544 --> 00:10:41,964
Your mother must have been
very thrown because of me.

147
00:10:42,757 --> 00:10:44,415
And you must have been startled too.

148
00:10:46,778 --> 00:10:48,197
I'm not letting you take it back.

149
00:10:49,851 --> 00:10:54,390
Even if you call in an hour
saying you'd lost your mind,

150
00:10:54,539 --> 00:10:58,127
and that we should pretend
it never happened, I won't allow it.

151
00:11:00,599 --> 00:11:01,706
All right.

152
00:11:01,737 --> 00:11:04,769
Even if you sleep on it
and change your mind,

153
00:11:04,993 --> 00:11:08,014
and ask me to forget you said it,
I won't allow it.

154
00:11:09,800 --> 00:11:10,842
All right.

155
00:11:11,058 --> 00:11:13,685
Even if you think it over and realize
you can't forget Han Gyu Rim,

156
00:11:13,710 --> 00:11:16,585
and come crying and begging,
I'm not letting you take it back.

157
00:11:18,379 --> 00:11:19,444
All right.

158
00:11:19,562 --> 00:11:21,678
There's no turning back now.

159
00:11:23,614 --> 00:11:26,535
- Right.
- Cross my heart and hope to die!

160
00:11:28,864 --> 00:11:33,909
That's it. I called to nail it down
for good, that's all.

161
00:11:35,004 --> 00:11:36,770
See you again tomorrow, Mu Jin.

162
00:11:37,623 --> 00:11:41,400
Yes. Sleep well.

163
00:12:19,318 --> 00:12:23,918
- What is this?
- Earthlings call this a cake.

164
00:12:25,084 --> 00:12:26,694
Today is my birthday...

165
00:12:27,847 --> 00:12:29,194
It's your birthday?

166
00:12:29,443 --> 00:12:32,964
You can't remember your own birthday
or mine, you heartless idiot.

167
00:12:33,610 --> 00:12:34,927
Just hold this for a second.

168
00:12:40,570 --> 00:12:43,027
Congratulations on day one.

169
00:12:43,248 --> 00:12:45,881
- Blow it out. I'll take a photo.
- What is this?

170
00:12:46,351 --> 00:12:47,655
Am I dating you?

171
00:12:48,566 --> 00:12:52,526
- Because you're really not my type.
- Are you insane? You're not mine either.

172
00:12:52,551 --> 00:12:55,238
I heard you've decided
to start seeing Seo Hyeon.

173
00:13:01,100 --> 00:13:02,566
The candle's melting.

174
00:13:02,591 --> 00:13:05,291
I begged them to stay open last night
so I could buy this.

175
00:13:15,997 --> 00:13:18,546
You did well. You did the right thing.

176
00:13:18,964 --> 00:13:22,646
A start doesn't have to be
a burning love on both sides.

177
00:13:22,671 --> 00:13:26,135
Feelings that weren't there
can grow as you go.

178
00:13:26,874 --> 00:13:28,508
Let's leave it at that.

179
00:13:31,324 --> 00:13:35,384
You ended things properly
with Han Gyu Rim, didn't you?

180
00:13:40,744 --> 00:13:42,884
I asked if you ended it properly
with Gyu Rim.

181
00:13:44,197 --> 00:13:48,654
When did I ever start
anything with Gyu Rim?

182
00:13:49,924 --> 00:13:53,267
You're right. You never even got to start.

183
00:13:56,664 --> 00:14:01,247
Either way, you change your mind
and everyone ends up happy.

184
00:14:07,658 --> 00:14:08,848
Is that really true?

185
00:14:10,362 --> 00:14:11,389
Is what true?

186
00:14:13,304 --> 00:14:17,198
That everyone really ends up happy.

187
00:14:28,724 --> 00:14:30,384
Why do you keep smiling?

188
00:14:31,150 --> 00:14:34,138
- Me? When?
- Just now.

189
00:14:35,991 --> 00:14:39,607
You were laughing out loud
in the shower earlier too.

190
00:14:39,731 --> 00:14:42,004
I could hear it all the way outside.

191
00:14:42,457 --> 00:14:45,505
I don't think I did. Did I really?

192
00:14:45,764 --> 00:14:48,327
Have you no pride either?

193
00:14:48,764 --> 00:14:51,859
You know how much grief
Mu Jin put Seo Hyeon through.

194
00:14:52,063 --> 00:14:55,597
And you melt this fast, laughing away.

195
00:14:56,164 --> 00:14:58,579
Are you really Seo Hyeon's father?

196
00:15:01,318 --> 00:15:03,673
You're laughing again.

197
00:15:05,897 --> 00:15:08,105
I don't like Mu Jin.

198
00:15:08,577 --> 00:15:10,994
Any man in the world but him.

199
00:15:11,237 --> 00:15:16,092
How does a grown man flip his heart
as easily as turning over his hand?

200
00:15:16,630 --> 00:15:19,494
How do we know when it'll turn again?

201
00:15:20,983 --> 00:15:25,775
That boy. If he puts Seo Hyeon
through this again, I swear I'll...

202
00:15:26,711 --> 00:15:31,907
Honey, are you holding back a laugh?

203
00:15:33,235 --> 00:15:34,948
Honey!

204
00:15:36,638 --> 00:15:39,312
In all the years I've known you,

205
00:15:39,336 --> 00:15:43,438
this is the first time I've seen you
leap up and shout at anyone.

206
00:15:44,290 --> 00:15:45,753
So it's funny to you?

207
00:15:45,976 --> 00:15:49,237
I jump up and shout and rage,
and you find that funny?

208
00:15:49,410 --> 00:15:54,987
No, it isn't funny.
I'm grateful, that's all.

209
00:15:57,423 --> 00:16:00,619
Seeing you this upset over Seo Hyeon,

210
00:16:00,781 --> 00:16:04,477
I find it lovely, and I'm so grateful.

211
00:16:05,751 --> 00:16:08,182
What is this man talking about?

212
00:16:08,207 --> 00:16:09,976
Do you know how adorable you are?

213
00:16:12,534 --> 00:16:14,328
Honey.

214
00:16:14,353 --> 00:16:15,970
Sometimes,

215
00:16:16,177 --> 00:16:20,642
I feel like the fake parent
and you're Seo Hyeon's real mother.

216
00:16:25,563 --> 00:16:28,014
- What are you talking about?
- What?

217
00:16:29,258 --> 00:16:31,134
I am Seo Hyeon's mother.

218
00:16:32,404 --> 00:16:34,971
She may not have come from my body,

219
00:16:35,476 --> 00:16:40,265
but from the moment I married you,
she was my child.

220
00:16:40,544 --> 00:16:43,675
I know. I know that well.

221
00:16:44,071 --> 00:16:45,810
Then why would you say such a thing?

222
00:16:47,544 --> 00:16:52,000
Aching and raging when your child
is hurting is what any mother does.

223
00:16:52,364 --> 00:16:55,722
What's lovely or grateful about that?

224
00:16:56,157 --> 00:16:58,051
What do you take me for?

225
00:16:58,231 --> 00:17:01,360
- How could you say that?
- Honey...

226
00:17:03,108 --> 00:17:05,220
That isn't what I meant.

227
00:17:07,196 --> 00:17:09,382
I'm sorry. I spoke without thinking.

228
00:17:09,549 --> 00:17:10,876
I'm truly sorry.

229
00:17:13,051 --> 00:17:16,700
Listen to me for a moment.

230
00:17:18,022 --> 00:17:20,064
What I wanted to say wasn't that.

231
00:17:20,677 --> 00:17:27,464
I meant, could I be a good father
to your children too?

232
00:17:30,004 --> 00:17:33,200
Gyu Rim, Gyu Yeong, and Gyu O, right?

233
00:17:34,100 --> 00:17:39,554
It's late, I know, but I'd like
to play a father to them...

234
00:17:39,921 --> 00:17:42,287
Could you give me that chance?

235
00:18:04,454 --> 00:18:06,012
Don't scold me.

236
00:18:06,821 --> 00:18:09,321
My blood pressure read 160 earlier.

237
00:18:10,221 --> 00:18:12,687
They say cucumber brings it down?

238
00:18:13,187 --> 00:18:16,617
There's some cucumber left.
Come put a slice on.

239
00:18:16,854 --> 00:18:20,451
I'll fold the laundry later
once my pressure drops.

240
00:18:21,361 --> 00:18:22,559
It's all right.

241
00:18:23,054 --> 00:18:26,002
Never mind that, come look after yourself.

242
00:18:26,854 --> 00:18:28,854
Gyu Yeong's wedding
is less than a month away.

243
00:18:30,421 --> 00:18:32,554
Give up on her wedding, Dad.

244
00:18:32,954 --> 00:18:34,787
The groom's side was told
you passed away...

245
00:18:35,421 --> 00:18:36,787
I'm not dead.

246
00:18:38,054 --> 00:18:39,983
I've risen again.

247
00:18:42,021 --> 00:18:46,219
Gyu Yeong thought it over
and realized she needed a father.

248
00:18:46,521 --> 00:18:48,800
She begged me on her knees.

249
00:18:49,421 --> 00:18:52,859
Said she was wrong and begged me
to come to the wedding.

250
00:18:53,221 --> 00:18:55,863
With tears rolling down her face...

251
00:18:56,454 --> 00:18:57,620
Gyu Yeong did?

252
00:18:57,787 --> 00:18:59,654
Yes. I...

253
00:19:00,054 --> 00:19:01,087
They've all fallen off.

254
00:19:01,381 --> 00:19:04,481
You know I'm weak to anyone who needs me.

255
00:19:05,154 --> 00:19:09,454
I was going to brush her off with,
"I don't have a daughter like you,"

256
00:19:09,687 --> 00:19:13,193
but I'm still her father.
How could I treat her the same way?

257
00:19:14,687 --> 00:19:19,424
So you play along too. Let's go together.

258
00:19:25,121 --> 00:19:28,547
Gyu Rim, just let her win.

259
00:19:28,621 --> 00:19:30,344
You are the eldest, after all.

260
00:19:43,574 --> 00:19:44,574
You startled me.

261
00:19:44,687 --> 00:19:47,021
I nearly pierced the wrong spot.
Ever heard of knocking?

262
00:19:47,154 --> 00:19:48,287
What have you done?

263
00:19:48,854 --> 00:19:50,754
Did you tell your in-laws
the truth about our father?

264
00:19:51,087 --> 00:19:54,256
- I heard you asked him to the wedding.
- As if.

265
00:19:54,321 --> 00:19:56,087
He actually believed the joke.

266
00:19:56,121 --> 00:19:58,154
Did you lie to him?

267
00:19:58,513 --> 00:20:01,331
It wasn't a lie. It was a joke.

268
00:20:03,821 --> 00:20:05,530
You pick your lies more carefully.

269
00:20:05,687 --> 00:20:08,656
He's so worked up about
going to your wedding.

270
00:20:09,221 --> 00:20:12,145
You're the one who can calm him down.
Hand me the earring.

271
00:20:12,354 --> 00:20:14,496
You made this mess, so you clean it up.

272
00:20:14,521 --> 00:20:16,754
Give it here. I have to get to work.

273
00:20:16,887 --> 00:20:19,085
Clean it up first, then go.

274
00:20:19,754 --> 00:20:21,915
He didn't do what I asked him either.

275
00:20:22,087 --> 00:20:23,654
What did you ask him to do?

276
00:20:25,521 --> 00:20:27,810
I said, what did you ask him to do?

277
00:20:30,087 --> 00:20:32,919
To tell Su Nam and that freeloader...

278
00:20:33,467 --> 00:20:35,469
To tell Cho Heung Sik that
Gyeol's father came back. So what?

279
00:20:38,554 --> 00:20:39,821
You put him up to that?

280
00:20:39,887 --> 00:20:42,661
Yes, I did. To split you
and Cho Heung Sik apart.

281
00:20:42,887 --> 00:20:43,887
Why?

282
00:20:44,987 --> 00:20:47,943
Because of you he keeps meddling
in my business and threatening me.

283
00:20:48,967 --> 00:20:51,917
So you're the one who made Su Nam cry.

284
00:20:52,087 --> 00:20:53,087
What?

285
00:20:53,112 --> 00:20:55,379
Who are you to hurt people that good?

286
00:20:55,827 --> 00:21:00,197
Without those two, our family
wouldn't even have gotten by.

287
00:21:00,613 --> 00:21:04,156
Who are you? Who am I?

288
00:21:12,493 --> 00:21:13,976
It's Gyeol.

289
00:21:14,187 --> 00:21:16,921
How are you feeling today?

290
00:21:17,121 --> 00:21:18,654
Much better.

291
00:21:18,679 --> 00:21:20,738
The cast comes off soon.

292
00:21:21,187 --> 00:21:22,321
That's a relief.

293
00:21:22,454 --> 00:21:24,354
It was never that bad to begin with.

294
00:21:24,692 --> 00:21:27,162
You don't need to worry so much.

295
00:21:27,187 --> 00:21:28,781
But listen,

296
00:21:29,087 --> 00:21:32,587
I hear my mom proposed to you.

297
00:21:32,907 --> 00:21:35,144
Gyeol, how do you know that?

298
00:21:36,587 --> 00:21:37,587
Unbelievable.

299
00:21:37,587 --> 00:21:38,987
My mom told me.

300
00:21:39,421 --> 00:21:42,354
And that she's waiting for your answer.

301
00:21:42,833 --> 00:21:46,408
So when are you going to answer?

302
00:21:46,954 --> 00:21:50,029
Does it take long? How long?

303
00:21:50,687 --> 00:21:53,621
Well, the thing is...

304
00:21:54,254 --> 00:21:58,154
Whether I'm even allowed
to give an answer or not...

305
00:21:58,154 --> 00:22:00,587
Whether I have the right to or not...

306
00:22:03,921 --> 00:22:05,821
Could you hurry it up a bit?

307
00:22:06,754 --> 00:22:11,533
If you answer soon,
I think I can decide soon too.

308
00:22:12,354 --> 00:22:16,221
Then could you just tell me the odds,

309
00:22:16,454 --> 00:22:20,095
of accepting my mom's confession
or turning it down?

310
00:22:20,940 --> 00:22:22,111
The odds?

311
00:22:24,087 --> 00:22:26,887
Why even ask? It's a hundred to zero.

312
00:22:26,987 --> 00:22:27,987
Han Gyu O.

313
00:22:28,154 --> 00:22:30,721
What are you doing? That's my phone.
Put it to my ear, quickly.

314
00:22:32,621 --> 00:22:35,146
By the way, Gyeol, you're so cool.

315
00:22:35,606 --> 00:22:36,606
How so?

316
00:22:37,054 --> 00:22:39,887
I figured if your mom got a boyfriend,
you'd tell her to break up on the spot,

317
00:22:40,287 --> 00:22:44,021
beg her to focus only on you,
throw a fit, cry your eyes out.

318
00:22:44,854 --> 00:22:46,754
But you're so cool about it.
I'm honestly amazed.

319
00:22:46,854 --> 00:22:48,425
I suppose I am like that.

320
00:22:53,568 --> 00:22:55,587
I have to get to class. Bye.

321
00:22:58,594 --> 00:23:01,887
Tell Cho Heung Sik I'll call him again.

322
00:23:12,154 --> 00:23:13,487
Mu Jin and Seo Hyeon?

323
00:23:14,000 --> 00:23:15,121
Since when?

324
00:23:15,854 --> 00:23:18,887
Yes, but Yun Hui is dead set against it.

325
00:23:19,274 --> 00:23:20,312
Yun Hui is?

326
00:23:21,854 --> 00:23:25,554
Well, Mu Jin did put Seo Hyeon
through an awful lot.

327
00:23:26,521 --> 00:23:28,821
Still, they say no parent
ever wins against a child.

328
00:23:30,107 --> 00:23:31,354
Look who's talking...

329
00:23:31,754 --> 00:23:35,354
You've always won against your children.

330
00:23:36,487 --> 00:23:37,954
Hun Tae, what about you?

331
00:23:38,201 --> 00:23:40,462
- Are you against Mu Jin too?
- Me?

332
00:23:41,521 --> 00:23:45,187
Well, if Seo Hyeon likes him...

333
00:23:45,687 --> 00:23:50,121
Whatever grudges there were,
I'd like to see them work out...

334
00:23:51,056 --> 00:23:52,554
I don't know.

335
00:23:53,121 --> 00:23:56,060
If Yun Hui keeps opposing it,
it puts me in a difficult spot.

336
00:23:56,600 --> 00:24:01,605
So, are you and Yun Hui free this evening?

337
00:24:02,107 --> 00:24:06,161
I'd like to talk it over with her
at least over dinner.

338
00:24:06,987 --> 00:24:09,245
All right. Put in a word for me.

339
00:24:09,653 --> 00:24:11,145
I'm counting on you, my friend.

340
00:24:20,687 --> 00:24:21,687
Are you busy?

341
00:24:23,421 --> 00:24:28,188
Did Mu Jin really ask
to start seeing Seo Hyeon?

342
00:24:28,454 --> 00:24:31,387
He said it right in front of her mother.
Asked for her permission.

343
00:24:32,621 --> 00:24:33,954
What about Han Gyu Rim...

344
00:24:35,821 --> 00:24:37,963
- And what about his son?
- Hold your tongue.

345
00:24:39,887 --> 00:24:43,287
We don't even know for certain
if he's Mu Jin's son. Not another word.

346
00:24:44,854 --> 00:24:46,694
So should I stop looking into it too?

347
00:24:48,321 --> 00:24:49,699
Put it on hold for now.

348
00:24:50,421 --> 00:24:53,754
If Seo Hyeon's family finds out,
nothing good comes of it.

349
00:24:53,880 --> 00:24:56,914
They've barely gotten started.
Why pour cold water on it?

350
00:24:58,354 --> 00:25:00,108
Nothing stays secret forever.

351
00:25:00,321 --> 00:25:03,408
They'll find out eventually, but not now.

352
00:25:30,021 --> 00:25:31,154
This is the last order, right?

353
00:25:31,220 --> 00:25:34,453
Yes, Chef. I've learned so much.
Thank you for everything.

354
00:25:50,687 --> 00:25:52,679
What's with the face? You're scaring me.

355
00:25:53,521 --> 00:25:54,921
There's a customer.

356
00:26:00,221 --> 00:26:01,787
It's almost break time. What customer?

357
00:26:01,820 --> 00:26:03,238
Yours, actually.

358
00:26:03,954 --> 00:26:06,921
You guys just eat
and take your break as usual.

359
00:26:07,021 --> 00:26:09,394
You never let me finish a sentence.

360
00:26:12,566 --> 00:26:13,566
Who is it?

361
00:26:22,154 --> 00:26:23,721
There's no straw.

362
00:26:26,687 --> 00:26:27,687
Right.

363
00:26:42,887 --> 00:26:44,321
What brings you here?

364
00:26:46,821 --> 00:26:48,221
I came by taxi.

365
00:26:50,361 --> 00:26:52,645
Is there something you wanted to say...

366
00:26:52,987 --> 00:26:56,155
Something to say, and something to ask.

367
00:27:00,460 --> 00:27:04,241
To be honest, I'm not Gyu Rim's husband.

368
00:27:05,780 --> 00:27:07,793
Yes, I know.

369
00:27:08,103 --> 00:27:10,954
You know? Did Gyu Rim tell you?

370
00:27:11,354 --> 00:27:12,587
Does that matter right now?

371
00:27:13,454 --> 00:27:15,921
Well, that isn't the important part...

372
00:27:18,154 --> 00:27:24,135
But yesterday Gyu Rim asked me
to start seeing her, as a man and a woman.

373
00:27:25,480 --> 00:27:27,981
Did you come here to gloat?

374
00:27:28,021 --> 00:27:30,409
I didn't come to gloat...

375
00:27:37,287 --> 00:27:38,944
One moment...

376
00:27:54,087 --> 00:27:56,228
Would it be all right
if I started seeing Gyu Rim?

377
00:27:59,068 --> 00:28:03,396
Whether you might start over with Gyu Rim,

378
00:28:03,721 --> 00:28:05,787
that's what I came here to find out.

379
00:28:05,812 --> 00:28:06,812
No.

380
00:28:07,520 --> 00:28:09,020
Why is your answer so fast?

381
00:28:09,354 --> 00:28:12,463
- I don't think you heard the question...
- No.

382
00:28:13,287 --> 00:28:15,587
Don't just say no to everything.

383
00:28:16,247 --> 00:28:19,038
- I'll ask slowly, so...
- No.

384
00:28:20,321 --> 00:28:24,279
Don't regret it later. I'll count to ten,

385
00:28:24,487 --> 00:28:26,954
so think it through and answer.

386
00:28:27,840 --> 00:28:29,263
- One.
- No.

387
00:28:30,254 --> 00:28:32,290
There will never be
any chance of us again.

388
00:28:34,921 --> 00:28:39,757
Can you really cut off feelings
as cleanly as you slice a radish?

389
00:28:40,354 --> 00:28:42,287
What answer are you hoping to hear?

390
00:28:42,521 --> 00:28:44,762
An honest one.

391
00:28:44,787 --> 00:28:47,887
Hand on your heart, tell me the truth...

392
00:28:48,054 --> 00:28:51,485
An honest answer
with nothing to be ashamed of.

393
00:28:52,854 --> 00:28:56,621
I've told you no again and again,
but you don't seem to understand.

394
00:28:57,521 --> 00:28:59,125
I'm rather busy today.

395
00:28:59,768 --> 00:29:01,568
Please leave. I'll call you a taxi.

396
00:29:02,221 --> 00:29:03,391
Would you like more?

397
00:29:11,533 --> 00:29:13,733
- That's not what I meant...
- Get up, please.

398
00:29:13,961 --> 00:29:18,063
Nice.

399
00:29:18,374 --> 00:29:22,384
Three days of stress, gone just like that.

400
00:29:23,511 --> 00:29:26,921
Doesn't the owner mind you coming
this often without buying anything?

401
00:29:26,954 --> 00:29:29,103
Not at all. Come every day if you like.

402
00:29:30,687 --> 00:29:34,529
Tell Gyu Rim, whenever you get a chance,

403
00:29:34,554 --> 00:29:36,721
to slip one of these into my room.

404
00:29:36,881 --> 00:29:37,881
Yes.

405
00:29:40,887 --> 00:29:42,607
This is driving me mad.

406
00:29:42,821 --> 00:29:44,877
You pull a stunt that awful,

407
00:29:45,053 --> 00:29:48,053
and then lie around like this
without a care in the world.

408
00:29:48,087 --> 00:29:49,487
Get up this instant.

409
00:29:49,621 --> 00:29:51,787
I'm about to grab you by the collar.

410
00:29:51,987 --> 00:29:54,988
Why would you grab my collar?

411
00:29:55,287 --> 00:29:56,953
Does my collar belong to you?

412
00:29:57,121 --> 00:29:59,206
What did you tell me yesterday?

413
00:29:59,627 --> 00:30:02,641
That Gyeol's father had shown up?

414
00:30:03,021 --> 00:30:05,487
That Gyu Rim and my Heung Sik,

415
00:30:05,521 --> 00:30:08,654
should each go their own way.
Did you say that or not?

416
00:30:09,254 --> 00:30:12,421
What on earth do you have against me,

417
00:30:12,454 --> 00:30:14,983
telling such a vile lie?

418
00:30:16,121 --> 00:30:19,162
Why would that be a lie?
Do you have proof it is?

419
00:30:19,187 --> 00:30:22,021
Proof?

420
00:30:22,287 --> 00:30:25,255
If what you say is true,
then why would Gyu Rim...

421
00:30:25,328 --> 00:30:29,421
go and propose to my Heung Sik?

422
00:30:30,087 --> 00:30:32,374
You answer that first.

423
00:30:32,721 --> 00:30:38,520
Is Gyu Rim the sort
to date two men at once?

424
00:30:42,387 --> 00:30:45,968
What? My Gyu Rim proposed?

425
00:30:46,460 --> 00:30:49,825
- Hold on. Stop for a second.
- Yes.

426
00:30:50,287 --> 00:30:55,198
So she wasn't proposed to.
My Gyu Rim asked first?

427
00:30:55,954 --> 00:30:57,940
Aren't you the one telling lies?

428
00:30:58,687 --> 00:31:03,231
If you really can't believe it,
go ask Gyu Rim yourself.

429
00:31:06,754 --> 00:31:10,083
Have these kids all eaten
something they shouldn't have?

430
00:31:10,487 --> 00:31:12,421
What is wrong with everyone lately?

431
00:31:12,554 --> 00:31:18,178
Thinking of the grief I've been through,
I ought to get some of my own back,

432
00:31:18,354 --> 00:31:21,102
so what should I do?

433
00:31:21,321 --> 00:31:25,196
A few months back, you were drunk
in broad daylight,

434
00:31:25,221 --> 00:31:28,237
relieving yourself
against that wall over there...

435
00:31:30,487 --> 00:31:33,154
What is wrong with you?

436
00:31:35,754 --> 00:31:38,087
- You must have energy to spare.
- I do.

437
00:31:38,121 --> 00:31:40,987
I have plenty to spare for you.

438
00:31:41,154 --> 00:31:42,254
Salty!

439
00:31:55,687 --> 00:31:57,062
It's all patchy.

440
00:32:01,054 --> 00:32:03,954
I'm Han Gyu Yeong.

441
00:32:05,144 --> 00:32:06,587
Why isn't she here yet?

442
00:32:07,308 --> 00:32:08,587
When is she coming?

443
00:32:12,221 --> 00:32:14,887
Why can't I get anything right?

444
00:32:16,420 --> 00:32:20,440
The great Han Gyu Yeong,
reduced to scratching lottery tickets.

445
00:32:34,121 --> 00:32:35,821
I'm sorry to keep you waiting.

446
00:32:36,007 --> 00:32:37,343
I'm Kim Yun Jin.

447
00:32:39,621 --> 00:32:41,654
I need to get my business cards remade.

448
00:32:41,732 --> 00:32:42,898
I'm Han Gyu Yeong.

449
00:32:44,221 --> 00:32:45,354
Han Gyu Yeong?

450
00:32:47,221 --> 00:32:48,987
I know someone with a similar name.

451
00:32:51,107 --> 00:32:53,199
Do you? What's the name?

452
00:32:54,460 --> 00:32:58,721
The name is similar,
but she's nothing like you at all.

453
00:33:00,687 --> 00:33:03,656
Anyway, you came up with
quite an interesting idea.

454
00:33:04,087 --> 00:33:06,798
That's why I pushed so hard to meet you.

455
00:33:09,387 --> 00:33:13,521
However well makeup goes on, it darkens
and breaks down as the day wears on.

456
00:33:13,640 --> 00:33:15,807
That's why everyone is desperate
to touch it up.

457
00:33:16,254 --> 00:33:20,087
But that's because skincare never built
a proper base in the first place.

458
00:33:20,527 --> 00:33:24,227
If the skin itself is in good condition,
doesn't the makeup last?

459
00:33:24,787 --> 00:33:27,887
Looking beautiful all day long,
that's makeup that truly holds.

460
00:33:29,311 --> 00:33:30,427
I like it.

461
00:33:33,427 --> 00:33:35,649
So there really are geniuses out there.

462
00:33:36,554 --> 00:33:37,806
I feel completely outclassed.

463
00:33:43,468 --> 00:33:44,854
Let's work together.

464
00:33:44,987 --> 00:33:49,266
And the terms will be
the best in the field.

465
00:33:50,921 --> 00:33:53,371
Thank you. I'll work hard.

466
00:33:53,754 --> 00:33:55,826
- Do your best.
- Yes.

467
00:34:11,187 --> 00:34:12,521
Yes, ma'am.

468
00:34:12,667 --> 00:34:15,300
Gyu Yeong, I'm not calling
at a busy time, am I?

469
00:34:15,393 --> 00:34:17,701
Not at all. I was taking a break.

470
00:34:18,160 --> 00:34:21,434
I should have called you first.
I'm sorry, ma'am.

471
00:34:24,132 --> 00:34:26,836
There's less than a month
until the ceremony...

472
00:34:27,121 --> 00:34:31,887
I was wondering how the preparations
and the gifts were coming along.

473
00:34:32,021 --> 00:34:35,254
Yes, it's all coming along nicely.

474
00:34:35,279 --> 00:34:40,132
You know, your family and ours
have a certain social standing...

475
00:34:40,254 --> 00:34:45,804
You know everyone is saying
we're keeping it far too modest.

476
00:34:46,287 --> 00:34:49,421
Exactly. But you said so yourself.

477
00:34:49,487 --> 00:34:51,654
That people in our position
should set an example.

478
00:34:51,754 --> 00:34:53,986
You were absolutely right.

479
00:34:54,143 --> 00:34:57,796
And looking again, I'd left out
my fourth sister-in-law.

480
00:34:57,889 --> 00:35:02,444
She'd divorced my fourth brother, you see.

481
00:35:03,260 --> 00:35:05,311
But they reconciled before the wedding.

482
00:35:05,336 --> 00:35:09,846
Leaving her out would sting,
so let's keep it simple,

483
00:35:10,100 --> 00:35:12,988
and prepare one more crocodile-skin bag.
All right?

484
00:35:13,730 --> 00:35:15,717
Of course. That's fine.

485
00:35:15,742 --> 00:35:20,669
- Gyu Yeong, have a lovely day.
- Yes, you too.

486
00:35:28,390 --> 00:35:30,237
I'd like to close out my savings account.

487
00:35:31,184 --> 00:35:34,211
Ma'am, it matures in three months.

488
00:35:34,309 --> 00:35:38,314
Yes, I know that better than anyone
and it's breaking my heart,

489
00:35:38,622 --> 00:35:40,323
so please just close it.

490
00:35:41,496 --> 00:35:46,125
Yes, then I'll process the closure
as of today's date.

491
00:35:52,190 --> 00:35:56,956
I graduated from a top
medical school here,

492
00:35:56,981 --> 00:35:58,951
then a prestigious one in the States,

493
00:35:58,982 --> 00:36:01,769
and I work as a staff physician
at a dermatology clinic in Apgujeong.

494
00:36:03,230 --> 00:36:07,172
How large a credit line
could I get, by any chance?

495
00:36:08,097 --> 00:36:09,678
One moment.

496
00:36:22,647 --> 00:36:24,639
(Daebak Loan Capital)

497
00:37:18,077 --> 00:37:23,304
No, once I'm married,
I can pay it right back.

498
00:37:24,056 --> 00:37:28,711
My in-laws are seriously rich.

499
00:37:39,363 --> 00:37:43,563
Stop reading me and just say it.

500
00:37:43,950 --> 00:37:47,230
What could I possibly have to say?

501
00:37:47,376 --> 00:37:52,183
If there were a hole in the ground,
I'd crawl right in and hide.

502
00:37:53,344 --> 00:37:55,857
What if there's a hole
in the side dish shop?

503
00:37:55,936 --> 00:37:57,650
Then we'd have to close down.

504
00:37:59,390 --> 00:38:01,576
You're smiling at me.

505
00:38:02,216 --> 00:38:04,602
Have you forgiven me already?

506
00:38:06,224 --> 00:38:09,457
I'd have done the same in your place.

507
00:38:10,203 --> 00:38:12,032
You had every right to be angry.

508
00:38:14,168 --> 00:38:18,583
Stop trying to understand me.
Shout at me instead.

509
00:38:18,663 --> 00:38:21,211
Call me a wretched old woman.

510
00:38:21,236 --> 00:38:23,789
Tell me I should have heard you out
and believed you first.

511
00:38:23,864 --> 00:38:26,284
Ask if I got this old for nothing.

512
00:38:28,303 --> 00:38:30,096
I'll do better.

513
00:38:30,744 --> 00:38:34,348
You'd believe me if I said
the moon was made of cheese.

514
00:38:34,404 --> 00:38:37,617
I'll do better so you can say that.

515
00:38:39,843 --> 00:38:44,221
Take away the flaws
and you're practically perfect.

516
00:38:44,763 --> 00:38:48,173
How could I not fall for you?

517
00:38:52,363 --> 00:38:55,690
It's past lunchtime.
Shall we pull the shutter down,

518
00:38:55,756 --> 00:38:58,720
and go get some ribs up the road?

519
00:39:00,050 --> 00:39:02,482
Let's go when Heung Sik is better.

520
00:39:03,523 --> 00:39:07,350
Already looking after my Heung Sik.

521
00:39:08,497 --> 00:39:10,830
I'd better not tell him.

522
00:39:11,083 --> 00:39:15,213
What if the shock stops his heart
and takes him first?

523
00:39:15,238 --> 00:39:16,899
That won't do.

524
00:39:18,089 --> 00:39:20,495
- I should stir-fry the greens.
- Yes, go on.

525
00:39:25,378 --> 00:39:29,067
My mouth keeps twitching to speak,

526
00:39:29,345 --> 00:39:30,979
so I might as well buy a horn,

527
00:39:31,112 --> 00:39:36,581
and go around announcing that Gyu Rim
and Cho Heung Sik are dating.

528
00:39:37,903 --> 00:39:39,866
He hasn't answered me yet.

529
00:39:39,983 --> 00:39:43,426
What? Still? He hasn't answered?

530
00:39:43,998 --> 00:39:47,925
A man with nothing to do,
what is he hesitating about?

531
00:39:49,697 --> 00:39:52,117
He probably needs time to think.

532
00:39:52,350 --> 00:39:54,446
Think about what?

533
00:39:54,477 --> 00:39:57,980
He hit the lottery of a lifetime,

534
00:39:58,018 --> 00:40:00,776
and it's driven him clean out of his mind.

535
00:40:01,257 --> 00:40:04,854
Too well off for his own good.
The rotten fool!

536
00:40:08,919 --> 00:40:11,663
Nice.

537
00:40:24,383 --> 00:40:25,590
You know me, right?

538
00:40:26,617 --> 00:40:28,244
No, I don't.

539
00:40:29,157 --> 00:40:30,350
You really don't?

540
00:40:30,977 --> 00:40:33,496
I said I don't. Who are you?

541
00:40:34,318 --> 00:40:36,936
Well done, Kwon Hui Na.

542
00:40:37,643 --> 00:40:39,460
What good would it do to acknowledge him?

543
00:40:39,754 --> 00:40:41,104
Well done.

544
00:40:42,315 --> 00:40:43,941
(Su Nam)

545
00:40:48,597 --> 00:40:51,265
- Yes, Su Nam.
- Is now a good time?

546
00:40:51,456 --> 00:40:54,228
- I'm not calling while you're busy?
- No, it's fine.

547
00:40:54,383 --> 00:40:57,858
I made some of the dishes you like.
Come and take some.

548
00:40:57,883 --> 00:41:02,413
Actually, if you don't have other plans,
just come by the house tonight.

549
00:41:02,494 --> 00:41:05,437
If Heung Sik were well,
I'd have sent him over.

550
00:41:05,650 --> 00:41:07,410
What's wrong with Heung Sik?

551
00:41:07,857 --> 00:41:12,261
It's nothing much. He got a little hurt.

552
00:41:13,303 --> 00:41:14,611
All right.

553
00:41:15,033 --> 00:41:17,634
I'll come see him after work.

554
00:41:17,736 --> 00:41:20,289
(Kwon Hui Na)

555
00:41:22,437 --> 00:41:24,676
You'll burn a hole through that phone.

556
00:41:25,197 --> 00:41:27,243
Are you waiting on a call?

557
00:41:28,630 --> 00:41:32,451
I left a voice message
and I think it was ignored.

558
00:41:32,476 --> 00:41:34,669
Someone actually ignores you?

559
00:41:35,824 --> 00:41:38,863
You dressed me well in this suit,
so the outing went fine.

560
00:41:39,641 --> 00:41:42,308
- Where did you go?
- You don't need to know.

561
00:41:45,390 --> 00:41:48,470
Someone's coming to visit me this evening.

562
00:41:48,883 --> 00:41:52,554
A cute, kind girl about your age.
You could be neighborhood friends.

563
00:41:53,604 --> 00:41:55,291
I'm not making friends with a girl.

564
00:41:55,784 --> 00:41:57,101
Forget it.

565
00:41:58,384 --> 00:41:59,610
Help me out of this.

566
00:42:00,910 --> 00:42:02,698
I can't manage alone.

567
00:42:03,625 --> 00:42:05,930
- Sorry.
- Take this off,

568
00:42:07,393 --> 00:42:08,851
and this.

569
00:42:13,765 --> 00:42:15,305
Thank you.

570
00:42:19,217 --> 00:42:21,517
I should pick up some fruit
Heung Sik likes.

571
00:42:28,870 --> 00:42:32,901
There, that side. That's it.

572
00:42:33,363 --> 00:42:36,783
This one goes here. Good.

573
00:42:39,290 --> 00:42:40,850
Mustard leaf kimchi.

574
00:42:40,875 --> 00:42:41,901
- More?
- Yes.

575
00:42:50,901 --> 00:42:52,553
(Kim Yun Gi)

576
00:42:56,230 --> 00:42:57,249
What?

577
00:42:57,274 --> 00:42:59,310
Gyu O, is the girl you're after
Kwon Hui Na?

578
00:43:00,178 --> 00:43:01,204
Why?

579
00:43:03,811 --> 00:43:05,271
Where are you now?

580
00:43:07,051 --> 00:43:08,616
Got it. I'll be right there.

581
00:44:08,763 --> 00:44:10,341
Gyu O, over here.

582
00:44:14,964 --> 00:44:16,790
This is my friend Han Gyu O,

583
00:44:17,425 --> 00:44:19,452
and this is my girlfriend, Seo Min Ju.

584
00:44:19,500 --> 00:44:21,769
- Hello.
- Hello.

585
00:44:23,336 --> 00:44:25,632
Kwon Hui Na came up while we were talking,

586
00:44:25,810 --> 00:44:28,070
and Min Ju thinks she might be
someone she knows.

587
00:44:32,543 --> 00:44:34,576
This Kwon Hui Na must be something.

588
00:44:35,056 --> 00:44:39,531
He never moves when I call,
always too busy or bothered.

589
00:44:39,565 --> 00:44:40,967
You know Kwon Hui Na?

590
00:44:42,949 --> 00:44:44,890
Catch your breath, would you?

591
00:44:44,892 --> 00:44:47,114
Could you show me a photo?

592
00:44:47,139 --> 00:44:48,201
Gyu O.

593
00:44:55,956 --> 00:44:58,123
This isn't something strange, is it?

594
00:44:58,737 --> 00:44:59,886
No, sweetheart.

595
00:45:00,054 --> 00:45:02,019
She's a girl Gyu O really cared about,

596
00:45:02,044 --> 00:45:04,435
and he only wants to check
whether it's her.

597
00:45:04,764 --> 00:45:06,468
He won't bother her at all,

598
00:45:06,595 --> 00:45:08,496
and it won't put you in a spot either.

599
00:45:08,521 --> 00:45:10,535
Sweetheart, don't you trust me?

600
00:45:44,237 --> 00:45:48,315
Who knew that at nearly 70,

601
00:45:48,396 --> 00:45:52,110
I'd be spoon-feeding a 40-year-old son.

602
00:45:52,144 --> 00:45:53,643
You said I did well.

603
00:45:54,951 --> 00:45:56,674
Yes, that's right.

604
00:45:56,855 --> 00:46:00,144
You did. You did well.

605
00:46:00,536 --> 00:46:04,476
And thanks to that,
Gyu Rim even proposed to you.

606
00:46:04,584 --> 00:46:08,871
What? Heung Sik, you got proposed to?

607
00:46:09,201 --> 00:46:12,931
- No.
- What do you mean you didn't?

608
00:46:13,724 --> 00:46:17,317
He's just embarrassed, that's all.

609
00:46:18,331 --> 00:46:21,171
Hui Na, didn't you get a call?

610
00:46:21,557 --> 00:46:22,746
What call?

611
00:46:23,397 --> 00:46:27,064
The brother of the girl
who proposed to my Heung Sik.

612
00:46:27,190 --> 00:46:30,557
He set the table for us
and left just a moment ago.

613
00:46:30,763 --> 00:46:36,072
Anyway, he might end up
being family someday...

614
00:46:36,671 --> 00:46:38,997
Are you trying to set someone up again?

615
00:46:39,022 --> 00:46:44,982
I don't give your number
to just any guy, that's all.

616
00:46:45,543 --> 00:46:49,105
The rice cake shop lady says
he looks like a bit of a pretty boy,

617
00:46:49,418 --> 00:46:51,870
but he's nothing like his looks.

618
00:46:52,023 --> 00:46:56,470
Deep, kind, and hardworking.

619
00:46:56,791 --> 00:47:01,517
After Heung Sik,
he's the one man I'd vouch for.

620
00:47:01,542 --> 00:47:03,749
I'm not ready to meet anyone yet, Su Nam.

621
00:47:03,984 --> 00:47:06,898
No, that isn't what I meant...

622
00:47:06,963 --> 00:47:09,870
Are you acting as Cupid now?

623
00:47:09,952 --> 00:47:12,417
Young people handle it
themselves these days.

624
00:47:12,442 --> 00:47:14,888
Know when to step in and step out.

625
00:47:15,044 --> 00:47:17,084
What does that even mean?

626
00:47:17,109 --> 00:47:20,872
Step in when you should,
step out when you should. Read the room.

627
00:47:20,897 --> 00:47:24,491
When I feel like meeting someone,
I'll be sure to tell you,

628
00:47:24,516 --> 00:47:26,210
and then you can introduce me.

629
00:47:26,212 --> 00:47:29,624
That isn't what I meant...

630
00:47:29,626 --> 00:47:32,637
Can't you hear she doesn't want to?

631
00:47:32,662 --> 00:47:35,816
Just give me my food.
With the dried radish on top.

632
00:47:35,841 --> 00:47:37,327
Am I your servant?

633
00:47:37,949 --> 00:47:42,510
And why haven't you answered
Gyu Rim's proposal yet?

634
00:47:42,853 --> 00:47:45,072
Who do you think you are?
Are you that impressive?

635
00:47:45,097 --> 00:47:48,849
It's not that I'm impressive.
It's that I'm not.

636
00:47:49,024 --> 00:47:50,524
What's not impressive about you?

637
00:47:50,708 --> 00:47:53,403
After the way I raised you,
what isn't impressive?

638
00:47:53,428 --> 00:47:55,632
Stop twisting my words.

639
00:47:55,670 --> 00:47:58,813
When did I twist your words?
I've never twisted a thing.

640
00:47:58,930 --> 00:48:01,568
Would you two stop, please,

641
00:48:01,593 --> 00:48:04,618
- and let us eat.
- Yes, let's eat.

642
00:48:04,643 --> 00:48:07,140
Keep it up and I really will go home.

643
00:48:07,963 --> 00:48:10,278
You worthless little... Just eat...

644
00:48:17,904 --> 00:48:21,402
What kind of manners is it to ask for
a meeting and then keep me waiting?

645
00:48:21,843 --> 00:48:24,403
I know. The meeting must have run long.

646
00:48:24,591 --> 00:48:26,250
She said she'd be here soon.

647
00:48:28,198 --> 00:48:32,130
Honestly, mother and son both.
I can't stand either of them.

648
00:48:39,764 --> 00:48:44,321
Mr. Kim, could I call you back
in about two hours?

649
00:48:44,850 --> 00:48:45,871
What?

650
00:48:47,456 --> 00:48:49,714
I told you that won't work.

651
00:48:50,643 --> 00:48:52,441
I'll step out for a moment.

652
00:48:53,363 --> 00:48:56,121
I told Director Park to send the email.
You haven't checked it?

653
00:49:14,156 --> 00:49:16,255
Where are you going? The restroom?

654
00:49:17,441 --> 00:49:20,557
No. I'm going home.

655
00:49:22,671 --> 00:49:24,337
Where did Hun Tae go?

656
00:49:25,157 --> 00:49:27,236
He stepped out to take a call.

657
00:49:27,460 --> 00:49:30,750
When he's done, the two of you
have dinner together.

658
00:49:34,527 --> 00:49:37,244
Why so angry, I wonder?

659
00:49:38,737 --> 00:49:41,856
Is it because I was a little late?

660
00:49:44,025 --> 00:49:46,556
It was only 40 minutes.

661
00:49:47,452 --> 00:49:49,337
Only 40 minutes?

662
00:49:51,457 --> 00:49:54,297
We're not on such prickly terms.

663
00:49:54,391 --> 00:50:00,010
You've always understood my faults
and smoothed them over.

664
00:50:00,267 --> 00:50:04,287
And if things go well,
we'll be family by marriage.

665
00:50:05,115 --> 00:50:08,418
Who will? You and us?

666
00:50:09,077 --> 00:50:12,456
- Says who?
- Yun Hui.

667
00:50:12,481 --> 00:50:16,024
I have no intention whatsoever
of taking Mu Jin as a son-in-law.

668
00:50:16,690 --> 00:50:19,701
That's exactly what I came here
to tell you today.

669
00:50:20,530 --> 00:50:22,601
What can I do?

670
00:50:22,726 --> 00:50:26,278
- What would ease your anger?
- Do nothing.

671
00:50:26,497 --> 00:50:29,980
Whatever you do,
my answer will not change.

672
00:50:41,431 --> 00:50:43,049
That girl from back then.

673
00:50:43,671 --> 00:50:45,464
The one Mu Jin was in love with.

674
00:50:45,941 --> 00:50:52,004
Dirt-poor family, single father,
siblings one after another, no college.

675
00:50:53,544 --> 00:50:55,983
Is that what this is about?

676
00:50:56,800 --> 00:51:01,751
Is that all? He broke it off
with her a long time ago.

677
00:51:01,776 --> 00:51:04,672
Eight years ago. Cleanly.

678
00:51:06,417 --> 00:51:08,430
Did they really break up?

679
00:51:09,983 --> 00:51:14,638
Mu Jin and I have long forgotten her.
And you still remember?

680
00:51:16,242 --> 00:51:19,684
She was nothing but a gold digger.

681
00:51:20,644 --> 00:51:23,434
How would you know whether she was or not?

682
00:51:23,977 --> 00:51:26,837
Did you see her doing it?

683
00:51:26,994 --> 00:51:28,242
Yun Hui...

684
00:51:28,267 --> 00:51:31,511
That girl is someone's precious child too,

685
00:51:32,038 --> 00:51:35,004
so how can you speak of her so carelessly?

686
00:51:35,297 --> 00:51:38,182
Her parents would be sick
to hear you say that.

687
00:51:38,517 --> 00:51:39,611
Excuse me.

688
00:51:39,636 --> 00:51:44,160
Is this all the character a company
chairwoman can manage?

689
00:51:47,402 --> 00:51:52,978
I think you're overstepping
with me right now.

690
00:51:56,156 --> 00:51:58,569
You're the one who overstepped.

691
00:51:59,811 --> 00:52:03,710
Either way, not in a million years
will I allow those two to see each other.,

692
00:52:04,056 --> 00:52:06,149
will I allow those two to see each other.

693
00:52:17,497 --> 00:52:19,650
Unbelievable. Truly.

694
00:52:22,464 --> 00:52:23,718
Hold it in.

695
00:52:24,284 --> 00:52:27,521
They say patience three times over
saves you from murder. Hold it in.

696
00:52:28,917 --> 00:52:30,234
You're back?

697
00:52:31,750 --> 00:52:33,686
Where's my wife? The restroom?

698
00:52:33,711 --> 00:52:35,218
Where have you been?

699
00:52:35,631 --> 00:52:37,598
Your wife went home.

700
00:52:38,196 --> 00:52:40,496
What? Really?

701
00:52:42,240 --> 00:52:45,271
I've let this go long enough.
Why is your wife so out of line?

702
00:52:45,296 --> 00:52:46,331
About what?

703
00:52:46,606 --> 00:52:51,323
Anyone watching would think
she was that gold digger's mother.

704
00:52:51,460 --> 00:52:52,911
What are you on about now?

705
00:52:54,031 --> 00:52:55,540
Hold on.

706
00:53:00,918 --> 00:53:02,388
Is this really the best you can do?

707
00:53:02,623 --> 00:53:05,321
Do you honestly think this face
looks anything like this one?

708
00:53:07,151 --> 00:53:09,697
It may not be quite what you want yet,

709
00:53:10,011 --> 00:53:12,118
but there's still time before the wedding.

710
00:53:12,588 --> 00:53:16,189
With enough dieting and exercise,
we'll get him as slim as posible.

711
00:53:16,214 --> 00:53:21,667
He'll be a 100, 120 percent.

712
00:53:21,692 --> 00:53:23,900
Look at this. Right here.

713
00:53:25,961 --> 00:53:28,628
This face turns into this.

714
00:53:28,744 --> 00:53:32,247
Before and after. Perfect.

715
00:53:33,590 --> 00:53:35,374
- One moment.
- Yes.

716
00:53:36,744 --> 00:53:40,133
- Yes, Dad.
- What should I wear to your wedding?

717
00:53:40,524 --> 00:53:41,784
Anything.

718
00:53:42,311 --> 00:53:45,371
You've got such good looks
that anything suits you.

719
00:53:45,524 --> 00:53:48,762
I should get a facial too.
Shall I come to your clinic?

720
00:53:49,464 --> 00:53:52,291
Why would skin as good as yours
need a facial?

721
00:53:52,483 --> 00:53:54,611
Dad, I'm terribly busy right now.

722
00:53:54,711 --> 00:53:56,546
I'll call you back in a bit.

723
00:54:04,291 --> 00:54:08,250
- Shall we pick up where we left off?
- Yes.

724
00:54:08,413 --> 00:54:11,717
- There's just one problem.
- A problem?

725
00:54:11,977 --> 00:54:17,961
This one is only five feet tall.

726
00:54:18,146 --> 00:54:21,646
- We'll put him in lifts, of course.
- Sorry?

727
00:54:22,211 --> 00:54:24,830
How can you bring up something
that important only now?

728
00:54:25,031 --> 00:54:26,398
So what I'm saying is...

729
00:54:27,110 --> 00:54:31,898
We could stage a bad accident right before
the wedding and put him in a wheelchair...

730
00:54:31,923 --> 00:54:34,454
This man is a complete con artist.

731
00:54:34,718 --> 00:54:36,951
And you have the nerve
to ask for 10,000 dollars?

732
00:54:37,064 --> 00:54:38,617
Do I look like a pushover to you?

733
00:54:38,870 --> 00:54:41,494
Who's calling who a con artist?

734
00:54:41,791 --> 00:54:44,753
- Who proposed the fraud first?
- What?

735
00:54:44,858 --> 00:54:49,739
I went to the trouble of scouting actors
who fit your conditions,

736
00:54:49,764 --> 00:54:53,570
and came up with alternatives,
and now this...

737
00:54:54,258 --> 00:54:56,398
Forget it.

738
00:54:56,957 --> 00:54:57,957
I'm out.

739
00:54:58,436 --> 00:55:01,889
I'll just walk away.
This is too filthy to touch.

740
00:55:05,264 --> 00:55:08,651
Wait a moment.

741
00:55:10,488 --> 00:55:13,511
I'm sorry. I was thrown
and I lost my temper.

742
00:55:14,150 --> 00:55:16,628
Instead of a wheelchair,
what about serious injuries,

743
00:55:16,883 --> 00:55:21,094
face wrapped in bandages,
lying in a hospital bed?

744
00:55:28,417 --> 00:55:32,079
- We're closed for the day.
- I'm here about the job posting.

745
00:55:32,291 --> 00:55:34,823
Have you already filled it?

746
00:55:36,231 --> 00:55:37,844
She says she's here about the job.

747
00:55:39,597 --> 00:55:42,027
- A student?
- Yes. Eleventh grade.

748
00:55:42,178 --> 00:55:45,484
- Do you have your resume and health card?
- Yes.

749
00:55:46,877 --> 00:55:48,142
Let's see.

750
00:55:53,190 --> 00:55:55,937
Quite a bit of experience
at other restaurants.

751
00:55:55,962 --> 00:55:57,171
Is this the career you want?

752
00:55:58,260 --> 00:56:00,813
No. I want to be a designer.

753
00:56:01,330 --> 00:56:03,432
But I'll do well at whatever you give me.

754
00:56:05,374 --> 00:56:08,081
Bringing the health card
in advance tells me,

755
00:56:08,106 --> 00:56:12,571
you've read the wage
and the other terms on the site too.

756
00:56:12,671 --> 00:56:15,249
- Yes.
- Right.

757
00:56:17,706 --> 00:56:19,264
That was to myself.

758
00:56:22,891 --> 00:56:24,966
Still, nice of you to answer.

759
00:56:25,330 --> 00:56:28,830
Then let's start you tomorrow.

760
00:56:29,137 --> 00:56:32,317
For now, weekdays from dinner to close,

761
00:56:32,342 --> 00:56:35,132
and weekends from open through lunch.

762
00:56:35,711 --> 00:56:39,781
Sorry? I got it?
You're not asking anything else?

763
00:56:39,830 --> 00:56:43,647
No. We were looking for someone
sharp and good at the job,

764
00:56:43,687 --> 00:56:47,057
and someone like you came along,
so I'd say that's that.

765
00:56:47,663 --> 00:56:49,326
Yes, I'd say so.

766
00:56:50,083 --> 00:56:52,724
See you tomorrow. I'll work hard.

767
00:57:03,697 --> 00:57:07,458
It's all fine,
but why Han Gyu Min of all names?

768
00:57:07,911 --> 00:57:09,135
Han Gyu Rim.

769
00:57:09,744 --> 00:57:13,263
Just when I thought
I was getting free of Han Gyeol.

770
00:57:15,208 --> 00:57:18,912
It isn't as if there's only one
Han family in the whole country.

771
00:57:19,244 --> 00:57:23,149
I'm reading too much into it.

772
00:57:25,091 --> 00:57:26,611
Yes, lovely.

773
00:57:27,524 --> 00:57:30,259
Yes. A slight smile.

774
00:57:30,284 --> 00:57:31,581
Yes, that's good.

775
00:57:31,631 --> 00:57:34,121
All right, let's take a short break.

776
00:57:42,642 --> 00:57:44,342
- Hello.
- Hello.

777
00:57:48,629 --> 00:57:50,369
These are the models we just signed?

778
00:57:50,394 --> 00:57:53,546
- Yes, that's right.
- I don't think I've seen the boy before.

779
00:57:54,030 --> 00:57:55,668
- Is he new?
- Yes.

780
00:57:56,091 --> 00:58:00,014
He's in the eleventh grade
and hasn't been modeling long,

781
00:58:00,310 --> 00:58:02,170
so he doesn't have much runway
or shoot experience.

782
00:58:02,389 --> 00:58:07,004
But in the final round,
they picked him unanimously.

783
00:58:08,244 --> 00:58:10,041
Yes, going in.

784
00:58:12,385 --> 00:58:13,686
Lovely.

785
00:58:19,031 --> 00:58:20,264
Good pick.

786
00:58:20,371 --> 00:58:25,153
I'm not sure he's a jackpot,
but he's certainly no disappointment.

787
00:58:28,678 --> 00:58:30,024
You look wonderful.

788
00:58:31,704 --> 00:58:33,495
Yes, close-up.

789
00:58:43,857 --> 00:58:46,414
It's fine. I'm not cold.

790
00:58:47,850 --> 00:58:51,181
Just wear it. It gets chilly at night.

791
00:59:02,664 --> 00:59:03,988
What time do you get discharged tomorrow?

792
00:59:04,730 --> 00:59:06,131
Around three or four in the afternoon?

793
00:59:08,271 --> 00:59:09,448
I'll come pick you up.

794
00:59:09,750 --> 00:59:12,148
Tell your parents I'm coming.

795
00:59:12,844 --> 00:59:15,446
No. Don't come.

796
00:59:15,911 --> 00:59:17,866
Then you'd run into my mother again.

797
00:59:18,583 --> 00:59:22,911
For a while, it's better if you
and my mother don't cross paths.

798
00:59:24,697 --> 00:59:26,108
All right.

799
00:59:27,564 --> 00:59:30,493
Whatever my mother says,
don't give up on me.

800
00:59:32,791 --> 00:59:37,981
Gyu Rim, whatever happens
from now on, don't give up on me.

801
00:59:43,710 --> 00:59:44,763
Why?

802
00:59:44,788 --> 00:59:48,264
It's just so good I can hardly believe it.

803
00:59:50,095 --> 00:59:51,429
Your button came undone.

804
00:59:56,224 --> 00:59:58,009
He's my boyfriend.

805
00:59:58,424 --> 01:00:00,970
This man. He's my boyfriend.

806
01:00:00,995 --> 01:00:04,452
- Seo Hyeon.
- This man is my boyfriend.

807
01:00:05,530 --> 01:00:08,702
He's mine. This man is my boyfriend.

808
01:00:11,824 --> 01:00:13,543
What?

809
01:00:37,198 --> 01:00:38,497
Thank you.

810
01:00:50,218 --> 01:00:51,556
What is all this?

811
01:00:53,057 --> 01:00:54,411
What do you think? Wedding gifts.

812
01:00:54,471 --> 01:00:56,005
If you're going to stare,
help me carry them.

813
01:00:56,542 --> 01:00:59,452
No, you'll leave marks
on the shopping bags. Don't touch.

814
01:00:59,584 --> 01:01:01,539
What money did you buy all this with?

815
01:01:02,271 --> 01:01:03,863
Isn't this ridiculously expensive?

816
01:01:05,324 --> 01:01:07,711
It isn't stolen, so don't worry.

817
01:01:09,918 --> 01:01:10,991
Let's have a drink.

818
01:01:13,591 --> 01:01:14,924
My wedding is three weeks away.

819
01:01:15,038 --> 01:01:17,404
Do I need to have the dress
refitted after all that trouble?

820
01:01:17,524 --> 01:01:19,745
Then don't drink. I'll drink alone.

821
01:01:22,249 --> 01:01:26,523
I have something very important to say,
so don't try to slip away. Follow me.

822
01:01:29,511 --> 01:01:31,151
Why so gloomy about it?

823
01:01:33,496 --> 01:01:36,011
You can't even hold your drink.
What are you doing drinking?

824
01:02:03,784 --> 01:02:05,829
It turns out I'm the fool.

825
01:02:06,051 --> 01:02:07,698
I'm sorry, Gyu Yeong.

826
01:02:10,371 --> 01:02:16,698
You are getting married
and I've been no help at all.

827
01:02:19,158 --> 01:02:20,691
I'm truly sorry.

828
01:02:22,284 --> 01:02:23,391
Well, as long as you know.

829
01:02:25,005 --> 01:02:26,378
Is that what you called me out for?

830
01:02:26,698 --> 01:02:28,264
How annoying.

831
01:02:28,624 --> 01:02:30,257
But since I'm already sorry,

832
01:02:32,270 --> 01:02:35,206
- I might as well go all the way.
- What?

833
01:02:36,031 --> 01:02:39,277
I'm going to have to stop your wedding.

834
01:02:39,518 --> 01:02:42,434
- Hey.
- The lie you told your in-laws,

835
01:02:43,397 --> 01:02:46,244
tell them the truth yourself. By tomorrow.

836
01:02:46,269 --> 01:02:49,138
- Have you lost it?
- If you won't go, I will.

837
01:02:50,844 --> 01:02:53,544
You don't even know where or who.

838
01:02:55,571 --> 01:02:57,170
Heung Sik would know.

839
01:03:02,024 --> 01:03:04,611
You know once I snap, I really snap.

840
01:03:05,711 --> 01:03:09,206
And that nobody can stop me then.

841
01:03:10,937 --> 01:03:13,489
Hey. You, Gyu Rim.

842
01:03:13,618 --> 01:03:16,438
However ashamed you are of our family,

843
01:03:16,858 --> 01:03:20,150
how could you hire our own father
as a temp worker?

844
01:03:21,904 --> 01:03:25,481
No. I was wrong.

845
01:03:26,564 --> 01:03:28,711
I should have stopped you
right then and there.

846
01:03:29,724 --> 01:03:33,947
He isn't a temp. He's a father too.

847
01:03:34,570 --> 01:03:36,440
If he's Mom's husband,
that makes him a father.

848
01:03:38,558 --> 01:03:39,939
What are you talking about?

849
01:03:43,017 --> 01:03:45,097
He's the man Mom remarried.

850
01:03:45,931 --> 01:03:47,961
Mom's ex-husband and her current husband,

851
01:03:48,178 --> 01:03:50,792
between those two fathers,
I picked the better one.

852
01:03:53,351 --> 01:03:54,651
I never lied about a thing.

853
01:03:56,224 --> 01:03:57,885
How annoying.

854
01:05:20,084 --> 01:05:22,104
(Love on the Menu)

855
01:05:22,310 --> 01:05:25,204
Did anyone turn in anything
to lost and found yesterday?

856
01:05:25,304 --> 01:05:26,571
What is it you lost?

857
01:05:26,596 --> 01:05:28,824
I'm certain I lost something,

858
01:05:28,931 --> 01:05:31,077
but I can't work out what it was.

859
01:05:31,164 --> 01:05:32,671
What? Who? Han Gyu O?

860
01:05:32,782 --> 01:05:35,477
The way you looked at that photo
told a whole story.

861
01:05:35,576 --> 01:05:37,864
I've sent his number to your chat.

862
01:05:37,889 --> 01:05:42,335
To a household like yours
that tramples people,

863
01:05:42,411 --> 01:05:44,651
and lords it over them,
I won't give my daughter.

864
01:05:44,750 --> 01:05:46,470
Let it go here, Mu Jin.

865
01:05:46,495 --> 01:05:49,794
No matter how I try, I can't remember.

866
01:05:50,030 --> 01:05:51,803
Did you find what you lost?

867
01:05:53,105 --> 01:05:54,905
Dramaday.me
